Package: armatos-shell
Version: 2779.1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: quickshell (>= 0.3.0), qt6-wayland, qml6-module-qtquick-effects, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, fonts-ebgaramond, fontconfig, papirus-icon-theme, upower, wlsunset, brightnessctl, libpam-modules
Recommends: power-profiles-daemon, network-manager, bluez, pipewire, fprintd, libpam-fprintd
Maintainer: factionparadox <factionparadox@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Marmor: the Armatos Quickshell desktop shell
 The Titulus (the bar, with workspaces I-IX and readings in Roman numerals),
 the launcher ("Ave, Imperator. Quid imperas?"), Tabula Imperii (quick
 settings), edicta (notifications), the porta (lock screen, with fingerprint)
 and the Praetorians (the polkit agent). Carved Cinzel letters on marble and
 porphyry. Run it with:  qs -c armatos
